1
00:00:07,100 --> 00:00:08,150
(Leonard:)Hey, what's up?

2
00:00:08,210 --> 00:00:09,910
(Howard:)I need a place to crash.

3
00:00:09,920 --> 00:00:10,680
(Leonard:)Uh, sure.

4
00:00:10,680 --> 00:00:12,750
(Leonard:)Why?

5
00:00:12,750 --> 00:00:14,620
(Howard:)Big fight with my mother.

6
00:00:14,620 --> 00:00:18,860
Still arguing over
which CSI is the best?

7
00:00:18,860 --> 00:00:22,890
(Howard:)No, we agreed they all have
their merits.

8
00:00:22,890 --> 00:00:24,960
(Howard:)This was about Bernadette.

9
00:00:24,960 --> 00:00:27,060
(Sheldon:)What's going on?

10
00:00:27,070 --> 00:00:28,170
(Leonard:)Howard's gonna sleep here
tonight.

11
00:00:28,170 --> 00:00:29,550
(Leonard:)He had a fight with his mother.

12
00:00:29,550 --> 00:00:32,770
(Sheldon:)Did you offer him
a hot beverage?

13
00:00:39,210 --> 00:00:41,610
(Bernadette:)No.

14
00:00:43,320 --> 00:00:46,220
(Sheldon:)Leonard, social protocol states
when a friend is upset,

15
00:00:46,220 --> 00:00:48,450
(Sheldon:)you offer them a hot beverage,
such as tea.

16
00:00:48,450 --> 00:00:51,160
(Howard:)Tea does sound nice.

17
00:00:51,160 --> 00:00:53,410
(Sheldon:)You heard the man, Leonard.

18
00:00:55,990 --> 00:00:58,430
(Sheldon:)And while you're at it,
I'm upset

19
00:00:58,430 --> 00:01:04,020
(Sheldon:)that we have an unannounced
houseguest, so make me cocoa.

